// onsa.toml
// [test]
// spec = ["§2.2", "§15.1"]
// fixes = 0

// §2.2, §15.1: `static` is a reserved word, so a `use` that takes the name is E0200, in each form: at the end
// of a path, in a list and alone. Each form is in a module of its own (`main.onsa`, `in_list.onsa`,
// `alone.onsa`), so that no other `use` of the same name is in the way.
use kp.static                                       //~ E0200
